# iceland-device (Arch): units that the Pad 4 image does not use. Sorts before Arch's 90-systemd.preset, so a
# "systemctl preset" never enables them again.
# systemd-homed: the tablet has one normal local user (made by W2 with Fedora's uid / password hash); nothing of ours
# uses homed / userdbd home areas; pam_systemd_home in system-auth is a no-op without the daemon.
disable systemd-homed.service
disable systemd-homed-activate.service
